title: If you need more motivation
pid: cf064801-7543-438d-a7ad-c2880185fcdb
body: |2-
  to get excited about this idea:

  - [[id:0f802f23-3c0a-4d97-97dd-043949868aa0][Preempting some common concerns]] about ownership and privacy.
  - Some less obvious motivations
    - [[id:66b91932-6326-4686-a7e5-fc0140abb3f0][Writing is like thinking with power tools.]]
    - [[id:c4dcd4e3-fa61-437d-a008-ade72172ff5c][Traditional data ownership is awkward.]]
    - The web of thought experience feels good.
      - [[id:d6fc1d5d-daa7-467f-b241-1a6d35431a9e][It is liberating, fun, peaceful, and psychically integrating.]]
      - [[id:a350ea03-fafc-4d85-90b1-873f8845becc][It is Zen.]]
    - [[id:6305389e-733a-4534-acdf-7aafe774904a][Private writing is powerful.]]
    - [[id:9184bed5-2e38-41be-b6c5-f06fe7def415][Integrating your public and private writing only recently became possible]]
      - which is important, because [[id:66b91932-6326-4686-a7e5-fc0140abb3f0][writing is like thinking with power tools]].
  - And of course, [[id:50596504-bd3c-4656-8594-caede08f2c7e][sharing information is powerful.]]
